{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1245","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Constanze's Machine"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Constanze is the smartest girl in her village but she has bad eyesight."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day, she was able to invent an incredible machine! When you pronounce letters, the machine will inscribe them onto a piece of paper. For example, if you pronounce 'c', 'o', 'd', and 'e' in that order, then the machine will inscribe \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"code"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" onto the paper. Thanks to this machine, she can finally write messages without using her glasses."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, her dumb friend Akko decided to play a prank on her. Akko tinkered with the machine so that if you pronounce 'w', it will inscribe \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"uu"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" instead of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"w"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and if you pronounce 'm', it will inscribe \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nn"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" instead of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"! Since Constanze had bad eyesight, she was not able to realize what Akko did."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The rest of the letters behave the same as before: if you pronounce any letter besides 'w' and 'm', the machine will just inscribe it onto a piece of paper."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next day, I received a letter in my mailbox. I can't understand it so I think it's either just some gibberish from Akko, or Constanze made it using her machine. But since I know what Akko did, I can just list down all possible strings that Constanze's machine would have turned into the message I got and see if anything makes sense."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"But I need to know how much paper I will need, and that's why I'm asking you for help. Tell me the number of strings that Constanze's machine would've turned into the message I got."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"But since this number can be quite large, tell me instead its remainder when divided by $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are no strings that Constanze's machine would've turned into the message I got, then print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input consists of a single line containing a string $$$s$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |s| \\leq 10^5$$$) — the received message. $$$s$$$ contains only lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the number of strings that Constanze's machine would've turned into the message $$$s$$$, modulo $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nouuokarinn\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nbanana\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nnnn\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\namanda\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first example, the candidate strings are the following: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ouuokarinn"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ouuokarim"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"owokarim"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"owokarinn"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second example, there is only one: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"banana"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the third example, the candidate strings are the following: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nm"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mn"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nnn"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the last example, there are no candidate strings that the machine can turn into \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"amanda"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", since the machine won't inscribe 'm'."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1245C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1245/problem/C"}